---
description: Rules for the Unity integration package
globs: unity/**/*.cs
---
- Views read `EpisodeRunner.Episode`; only `EpisodeRunner` calls `Episode.Step`.
- Escape views (`Runtime/Escape/`) draw the truth plus WARDEN's belief, and never modify the `Stage`; they use `Stage` queries (`ToolTarget`, `ToolBlockedReason`, `InteractPrompt`) instead of re-deriving rules.
- Drone prototype views draw beliefs, not truth. The Seeker is shown only when the drone could see it, placed in the belief frame.
- Run `make unity-check` after any Unity change.
- Support both input backends (`#if ENABLE_INPUT_SYSTEM`); keep IMGUI HUD until the UI art pass.
- Convert types only through `UnityConvert`; draw order constants in `Layers`.
- Unity code cannot be compiled in CI: keep it thin, put logic in the core.
